  <note xmi:id="_6D3wg8mCEfClDv2KOrT7rQ" opaque="true" posX="32" posY="32" sizeHeight="161" sizeWidth="673" text="To see the SQLDemo in action, you need H2 Database Engine to be started. &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;This demo shows how to:&#xD;&#xA;- Declare a reusable DB connection&#xD;&#xA;- Create a DB table with an SQL statement&#xD;&#xA;- Insert data in a table with an SQL statement extracted from route message body&#xD;&#xA;- Read data from a DB">
